        "id": 5,
        "en": "The company's entire structure was torn down and rebuilt. Arthur's old department was closed. Employees who could not adapt were let go with severance packages. But Arthur still had a mortgage to pay and upcoming primary school tuition for his son. He had no choice but to accept a transfer to the department he was least familiar with: \"DevOps.\"\n\nAnd this morning was his very first day as a member of the Blue Team—the engineering team that looked after the core systems in Australia.",
